<title>UK: BZW/JP Morgan detail CADES $2.0 billion FRN.</title>
<headline>BZW/JP Morgan detail CADES $2.0 billion FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers BZW and J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CADES (CAISSE D'AMORTISSEMENT DE LA DETTE SOCIALE)</p>
<p> AMT	  $2.0 BLN  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    10.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     -3/16     PAY DATE    10.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA	 ISS PRICE  99.795    FULL FEES   0.15</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA	 REOFFER    99.795</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS     10K-1M    SALE LIMITS UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  FRANCE    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.05	SELL CONC  0.10	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> NOTES	GLOBAL ISSUE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
